{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112327","id":2970874245,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6xE_GF","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112327","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112327.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112327.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112327","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112327/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112327/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112327/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/efa1745b3ec1fe4e37244db835a69f52bc80edb7","number":112327,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add GridMap item categories","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds GridMap item categories and category tree view.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"840\" height=\"380\" alt=\"gridmap_categories\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/44239e5d-35f7-4bb2-9ac0-da0bc8426d15\" />\r\n\r\n### How does it work?\r\n\r\n`MeshLibrary` has a new item property `category` and related setgets `set_item_category(`) and `get_item_category().`\r\n\r\n<img width=\"454\" height=\"124\" alt=\"category_prop\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5414e024-bdc5-4780-9b19-fef028ff949a\" />\r\n\r\nThis string is used to create the new category tree view.\r\n\r\nIf the value is left empty (default) the item will be added to the default \"All\" tree root item.\r\n\r\nA category string can include \"`/`\" as a delimiter. This delimiter splits the string and turns the splits into tree sub categories.\r\n\r\nFor a quick overview how many items exist in a category the number of the available items in each category is shown to the right of the item tree view in the secondary column.\r\n\r\nThe search box was updated to filter for both item names and item categories.\r\n\r\n### MeshLibrary  scene exporter\r\n\r\nThe MeshLibrary scene exporter now reads the node metadata of each exported `MeshInstance3D` node.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"469\" height=\"94\" alt=\"node_metadata\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/377ff8e5-2435-4b45-8597-1d8b846c1283\" />\r\n\r\nIf it finds a `category` key with String(Name) value this string will be added as the category for the exported item.\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-11-02T20:33:13Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T18:09:01Z","closed_at":"2026-04-18T14:40:38Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cali